Negative control for filter-tristate.test.ts.

Drops `null` from the Verified leaf's declared members, so the tri-state loses
the unset position it clears through — the state the schema documents as "a
MEMBER, not an absence". Any assertion that reads the unset position, or the
clear it performs, goes red; one that only exercises the two set positions stays
green.

